    "chunk_text": "s cumende Ceadwalla mid weorode Westseaxna \u00e6\u00feeling, geong & from, Ac he w\u00e6s sona \u00f0onon adrifen from \u00f0\u00e6s cyninges ealldormonnum Berhthune & Andhune, \u00fea \u00deara se \u00e6rra w\u00e6s fram \u00feam ylcan Ceadwala ofslegen, \u00fea he Westseaxna cyning w\u00e6s, & \u00fea Swylce eac Ine, se \u00f0e \u00e6fter Ceadwalan to rice feng, gelicre geswencednesse monigra geara tide For \u00fe\u00e6re wisan w\u00e6s geworden \u00fe\u00e6t eallre \u00fe\u00e6re tide hi agenne bysceop habban ne mihton. Ac \u00fea Willfer\u00f0 bysceop w\u00e6s eft ham gela\u00f0ad, heora se \u00e6resta bisceop, sy\u00f0\u00f0an hie Westseaxna \u00c6fter \u00feon \u00fea \u00fee Ceadwala w\u00e6s gem\u00e6genad & gestrongod on Westseaxna rice, \u00fea geeode he Ond he gelice \u00fey troiscan w\u00e6le ealle \u00fea londbigengan wolde utam\u00e6rian & his agenra leoda Secga\u00f0 men, \u00fe\u00e6t he eac w\u00e6re mid gehate hine seolfne bindende \u00feeah \u00fee he \u00f0a gena in Criste ne & he \u00fe\u00e6t swa gel\u00e6ste, \u00fe\u00e6t \u00feone d\u00e6l he Wilfer\u00f0e biscope for Gode gesealde to brucenne, se in Is \u00fe\u00e6s ilcan ealondes gemet \u00e6fter Ongolcynnes eahte twelf hund hida. & he \u00fea \u00feam biscope gesealde in \u00e6ht \u00fereo hund hida, & \u00fe\u00e6r eahta to. Ond he \u00fea \u00feone d\u00e6l, \u00fee he onfeng, bebead sumum his preosta, \u00fe\u00e6s noma w\u00e6s Berhtwini, se Ond he sealde him m\u00e6ssepreost, \u00fe\u00e6s noma w\u00e6s Hiddila, se eallum \u00fe\u00e6m",
